        <body>
            <div xml:id="d897">

                <pb facs="0989" n="897" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg897"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/2618</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Persian Minister</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Mehdi Khan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 3, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: [I beg to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    note of December 17, in which you state that the Persian Government advised you
                    by cable to seek officially the assistance of the United States Government in
                    securing for Persia representation in the peace conference which will convene at
                    the termination of this great war, and also to assist Persia to maintain the
                    rights belonging to her as independent and sovereign state.</p>
                <p>Your note has been read with great interest and deep sympathy and the requests
                    contained therein are being very carefully studied by officials of the
                    Department. The magnitude of the problems involved has precluded a hasty answer
                    to the questions contained in your note. It is hoped, however, that it will be
                    possible to reply to your note in the very near future.]</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
